@startuml USLP09 - System Sequence Diagram

autonumber
actor "Traffic Manager" as Manager
participant ":System" as System

activate Manager

Manager -> System : initiates train assembly process
activate System
System --> Manager : requests starting facility ID
deactivate System


Manager -> System : enters start facility ID (e.g., "11")
activate System
    note right of System
        System retrieves locomotives and wagons
        available at or near the location
    end note
System --> Manager : displays list of available vehicles (SelectableVehicle)
deactivate System


loop while adding vehicles
    Manager -> System : selects vehicle by ID
    activate System
    System --> Manager : validates and adds to composition
    deactivate System
end


Manager -> System : confirms composition and departure time
activate System
    note right of System
        System creates Train, TrainLocomotive,
        and TrainWagonCargo entries
    end note
System --> Manager : confirms operation and displays new Train ID
deactivate System

deactivate Manager
@enduml